      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WC Deemed holding of information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Overseas recipients\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) an APP entity has disclosed personal information about one\nor more individuals to an overseas recipient; and\n\n(b) Australian Privacy Principle 8.1 applied to the disclosure of\nthe personal information; and\n\n(c) the overseas recipient holds the personal information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(d) the personal information were held by the APP entity; and\n\n(e) the APP entity were required under section 15 not to do an\nact, or engage in a practice, that breaches Australian Privacy\nPrinciple 11.1 in relation to the personal information.\nBodies or persons with no Australian link\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nparagraph 21G(3)(b) or (c), credit eligibility information\nabout one or more individuals to a related body\ncorporate, or person, that does not have an Australian\nlink; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(ii) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nsubsection 21M(1), credit eligibility information about\none or more individuals to a body or person that does\nnot have an Australian link; and\n\n(b) the related body corporate, body or person holds the credit\neligibility information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(c) the credit eligibility information were held by the credit\nprovider; and\n\n(d) the credit provider were required to comply with\nsubsection 21S(1) in relation to the credit eligibility\ninformation.\nNote:\nSee section 21NA.",
      "skos:definition": "Overseas recipients\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) an APP entity has disclosed personal information about one\nor more individuals to an overseas recipient; and\n\n(b) Australian Privacy Principle 8.1 applied to the disclosure of\nthe personal information; and\n\n(c) the overseas recipient holds the personal information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(d) the personal information were held by the APP entity; and\n\n(e) the APP entity were required under section 15 not to do an\nact, or engage in a practice, that breaches Australian Privacy\nPrinciple 11.1 in relation to the personal information.\nBodies or persons with no Australian link\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nparagraph 21G(3)(b) or (c), credit eligibility information\nabout one or more individuals to a related body\ncorporate, or person, that does not have an Australian\nlink; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(ii) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nsubsection 21M(1), credit eligibility information about\none or more individuals to a body or person that does\nnot have an Australian link; and\n\n(b) the related body corporate, body or person holds the credit\neligibility information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(c) the credit eligibility information were held by the credit\nprovider; and\n\n(d) the credit provider were required to comply with\nsubsection 21S(1) in relation to the credit eligibility\ninformation.\nNote:\nSee section 21NA.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6625d12fb2201bb2bb100ed363e14d7b616277bd7dfc19bb508e7d1dac03899a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WC Deemed holding of information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Overseas recipients\n\n(1) If:\n\n(a) an APP entity has disclosed personal information about one\nor more individuals to an overseas recipient; and\n\n(b) Australian Privacy Principle 8.1 applied to the disclosure of\nthe personal information; and\n\n(c) the overseas recipient holds the personal information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(d) the personal information were held by the APP entity; and\n\n(e) the APP entity were required under section 15 not to do an\nact, or engage in a practice, that breaches Australian Privacy\nPrinciple 11.1 in relation to the personal information.\nBodies or persons with no Australian link\n\n(2) If:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nparagraph 21G(3)(b) or (c), credit eligibility information\nabout one or more individuals to a related body\ncorporate, or person, that does not have an Australian\nlink; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(ii) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nsubsection 21M(1), credit eligibility information about\none or more individuals to a body or person that does\nnot have an Australian link; and\n\n(b) the related body corporate, body or person holds the credit\neligibility information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(c) the credit eligibility information were held by the credit\nprovider; and\n\n(d) the credit provider were required to comply with\nsubsection 21S(1) in relation to the credit eligibility\ninformation.\nNote:\nSee section 21NA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WC(1) Deemed holding of information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
