    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WC(2) Deemed holding of information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nparagraph 21G(3)(b) or (c), credit eligibility information\nabout one or more individuals to a related body\ncorporate, or person, that does not have an Australian\nlink; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(ii) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nsubsection 21M(1), credit eligibility information about\none or more individuals to a body or person that does\nnot have an Australian link; and\n\n(b) the related body corporate, body or person holds the credit\neligibility information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(c) the credit eligibility information were held by the credit\nprovider; and\n\n(d) the credit provider were required to comply with\nsubsection 21S(1) in relation to the credit eligibility\ninformation.\nNote:\nSee section 21NA.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nparagraph 21G(3)(b) or (c), credit eligibility information\nabout one or more individuals to a related body\ncorporate, or person, that does not have an Australian\nlink; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(ii) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nsubsection 21M(1), credit eligibility information about\none or more individuals to a body or person that does\nnot have an Australian link; and\n\n(b) the related body corporate, body or person holds the credit\neligibility information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(c) the credit eligibility information were held by the credit\nprovider; and\n\n(d) the credit provider were required to comply with\nsubsection 21S(1) in relation to the credit eligibility\ninformation.\nNote:\nSee section 21NA.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bf9ad2a83ff5428bf1abbf61fe372033d760fca5dab789349f04b2a1a1e63ff3",
      "skos:note": "Credit provider must comply with subsection 21S(1) in relation to credit eligibility information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WC(2) Deemed holding of information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n\n(a) either:\n\n(i) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nparagraph 21G(3)(b) or (c), credit eligibility information\nabout one or more individuals to a related body\ncorporate, or person, that does not have an Australian\nlink; or\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(ii) a credit provider has disclosed, under\nsubsection 21M(1), credit eligibility information about\none or more individuals to a body or person that does\nnot have an Australian link; and\n\n(b) the related body corporate, body or person holds the credit\neligibility information;\nthis Part has effect as if:\n\n(c) the credit eligibility information were held by the credit\nprovider; and\n\n(d) the credit provider were required to comply with\nsubsection 21S(1) in relation to the credit eligibility\ninformation.\nNote:\nSee section 21NA."
    },
