    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26we-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WE(2) Eligible data breach",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26we-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Act, if:\n\n(a) both of the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n(i) there is unauthorised access to, or unauthorised\ndisclosure of, the information;\n\n(ii) a reasonable person would conclude that the access or\ndisclosure would be likely to result in serious harm to\nany of the individuals to whom the information relates;\nor\n\n(b) the information is lost in circumstances where:\n\n(i) unauthorised access to, or unauthorised disclosure of,\nthe information is likely to occur; and\n\n(ii) assuming that unauthorised access to, or unauthorised\ndisclosure of, the information were to occur, a\nreasonable person would conclude that the access or\ndisclosure would be likely to result in serious harm to\nany of the individuals to whom the information relates;\nthen:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(c) the access or disclosure covered by paragraph (a), or the loss\ncovered by paragraph (b), is an eligible data breach of the\nAPP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file\nnumber recipient, as the case may be; and\n\n(d) an individual covered by subparagraph (a)(ii) or (b)(ii) is at\nrisk from the eligible data breach.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Act, if:\n\n(a) both of the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n(i) there is unauthorised access to, or unauthorised\ndisclosure of, the information;\n\n(ii) a reasonable person would conclude that the access or\ndisclosure would be likely to result in serious harm to\nany of the individuals to whom the information relates;\nor\n\n(b) the information is lost in circumstances where:\n\n(i) unauthorised access to, or unauthorised disclosure of,\nthe information is likely to occur; and\n\n(ii) assuming that unauthorised access to, or unauthorised\ndisclosure of, the information were to occur, a\nreasonable person would conclude that the access or\ndisclosure would be likely to result in serious harm to\nany of the individuals to whom the information relates;\nthen:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(c) the access or disclosure covered by paragraph (a), or the loss\ncovered by paragraph (b), is an eligible data breach of the\nAPP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file\nnumber recipient, as the case may be; and\n\n(d) an individual covered by subparagraph (a)(ii) or (b)(ii) is at\nrisk from the eligible data breach.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26we"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26we-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26we-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c40ef59c48892af00833c52d4682600a75c86d37611e5c01e60bef487459d53a",
      "skos:note": "Eligible data breach conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26we-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WE(2) Eligible data breach",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Act, if:\n\n(a) both of the following conditions are satisfied:\n\n(i) there is unauthorised access to, or unauthorised\ndisclosure of, the information;\n\n(ii) a reasonable person would conclude that the access or\ndisclosure would be likely to result in serious harm to\nany of the individuals to whom the information relates;\nor\n\n(b) the information is lost in circumstances where:\n\n(i) unauthorised access to, or unauthorised disclosure of,\nthe information is likely to occur; and\n\n(ii) assuming that unauthorised access to, or unauthorised\ndisclosure of, the information were to occur, a\nreasonable person would conclude that the access or\ndisclosure would be likely to result in serious harm to\nany of the individuals to whom the information relates;\nthen:\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 12, 2017\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\n\n(c) the access or disclosure covered by paragraph (a), or the loss\ncovered by paragraph (b), is an eligible data breach of the\nAPP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file\nnumber recipient, as the case may be; and\n\n(d) an individual covered by subparagraph (a)(ii) or (b)(ii) is at\nrisk from the eligible data breach."
    },
