      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the entity normally communicates with a particular individual\nusing a particular method, the notification to the individual under\nparagraph (2)(a) or (b) may use that method. This subsection does\nnot limit paragraph (2)(a) or (b).\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\nNo. 12, 2017",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the entity normally communicates with a particular individual\nusing a particular method, the notification to the individual under\nparagraph (2)(a) or (b) may use that method. This subsection does\nnot limit paragraph (2)(a) or (b).\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\nNo. 12, 2017",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wl"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wl-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wl-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7a663cbcad1e48fd2abd5848d64767bc93c9d7684f0324ded14b3a12c27245de",
      "skos:note": "Entity must notify eligible data breach using the same method used for communication."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wl-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WL(4) Entity must notify eligible data breach",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the entity normally communicates with a particular individual\nusing a particular method, the notification to the individual under\nparagraph (2)(a) or (b) may use that method. This subsection does\nnot limit paragraph (2)(a) or (b).\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\nNo. 12, 2017"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wl-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wl-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
