      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of a prescribed secrecy provision:\n\n(a) subparagraph 26WK(2)(a)(ii); and\n\n(b) section 26WL;\nare taken not to be provisions that require or authorise the use or\ndisclosure of information.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of a prescribed secrecy provision:\n\n(a) subparagraph 26WK(2)(a)(ii); and\n\n(b) section 26WL;\nare taken not to be provisions that require or authorise the use or\ndisclosure of information.",
