      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner’s power in paragraph (1)(d) may only be used\nto extend the time for compliance with subsection 26WL(2) to the\nend of a period that the Commissioner is satisfied is reasonable in\nthe circumstances.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commissioner’s power in paragraph (1)(d) may only be used\nto extend the time for compliance with subsection 26WL(2) to the\nend of a period that the Commissioner is satisfied is reasonable in\nthe circumstances.",
