    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WQ(3) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner must not make a declaration under\nsubsection (1) unless the Commissioner is satisfied that it is\nreasonable in the circumstances to do so, having regard to the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the public interest;\n\n(b) any relevant advice given to the Commissioner by:\n\n(i) an enforcement body; or\n\n(ii) the Australian Signals Directorate of the Defence\nDepartment;\n\n(c) such other matters (if any) as the Commissioner considers\nrelevant.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commissioner must not make a declaration under\nsubsection (1) unless the Commissioner is satisfied that it is\nreasonable in the circumstances to do so, having regard to the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the public interest;\n\n(b) any relevant advice given to the Commissioner by:\n\n(i) an enforcement body; or\n\n(ii) the Australian Signals Directorate of the Defence\nDepartment;\n\n(c) such other matters (if any) as the Commissioner considers\nrelevant.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3-logic-epistemic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cdd918e128fca2d9010ce21e7b382bac16d36f5ba20adfab5201d38e53ab1183",
      "skos:note": "The Commissioner must make a declaration only if it is reasonable in the circumstances."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WQ(3) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner must not make a declaration under\nsubsection (1) unless the Commissioner is satisfied that it is\nreasonable in the circumstances to do so, having regard to the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) the public interest;\n\n(b) any relevant advice given to the Commissioner by:\n\n(i) an enforcement body; or\n\n(ii) the Australian Signals Directorate of the Defence\nDepartment;\n\n(c) such other matters (if any) as the Commissioner considers\nrelevant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
