    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WQ(6) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(6) An application by an entity under paragraph (5)(b) may be\nexpressed to be:\n\n(a) an application for a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or\n\n(b) an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration; or\n\n(c) an application for:\n\n(i) a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or\n\n(ii) in the event that the Commissioner is not disposed to\nmake such a declaration—a paragraph (1)(d)\ndeclaration.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) An application by an entity under paragraph (5)(b) may be\nexpressed to be:\n\n(a) an application for a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or\n\n(b) an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration; or\n\n(c) an application for:\n\n(i) a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or\n\n(ii) in the event that the Commissioner is not disposed to\nmake such a declaration—a paragraph (1)(d)\ndeclaration.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9c7567171656c8ef85604fc294706cd7186df348ffd5caa8f0c08e3f6f64767b",
      "skos:note": "Application for declaration by Commissioner"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WQ(6) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(6) An application by an entity under paragraph (5)(b) may be\nexpressed to be:\n\n(a) an application for a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or\n\n(b) an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration; or\n\n(c) an application for:\n\n(i) a paragraph (1)(c) declaration; or\n\n(ii) in the event that the Commissioner is not disposed to\nmake such a declaration—a paragraph (1)(d)\ndeclaration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-6-norm",
