    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WQ(7) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b):\n\n(a) the Commissioner may refuse the application; and\n\n(b) if the Commissioner does so—the Commissioner must give\nwritten notice of the refusal to the entity.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b):\n\n(a) the Commissioner may refuse the application; and\n\n(b) if the Commissioner does so—the Commissioner must give\nwritten notice of the refusal to the entity.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e39b6b6914a9768b5c0b67a38959413c21affa17c3b407f6856d8f05774b5b7",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner must give written notice of refusal to entity applying under paragraph (5)(b)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WQ(7) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b):\n\n(a) the Commissioner may refuse the application; and\n\n(b) if the Commissioner does so—the Commissioner must give\nwritten notice of the refusal to the entity."
    },
