      "cml:integrityHash": "b737115452147c8c9484eec2944497c1e67c03cb1c7e39c575bef8e7a4caebd3",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner's declaration takes effect if application nominates a period and Commissioner specifies different period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WQ(8) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(8) If:\n\n(a) an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration nominates a\nperiod to be specified in the declaration; and\n\n(b) the Commissioner makes the declaration, but specifies a\ndifferent period in the declaration;\nthe Commissioner is taken not to have refused the application."
    },
    {
