      "cml:premiseText": "(8) If: an application for a paragraph (1)(d) declaration nominates a period to be specified in the declaration; and the Commissioner makes the declaration, but specifies a different period in the declaration;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the Commissioner is taken not to have refused the application."
    },
    {
