    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WQ(9) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(9) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b) for\na declaration that, to any extent, relates to an eligible data breach of\nthe entity, sections 26WK and 26WL do not apply in relation to:\n\n(a) the eligible data breach; or\n\n(b) if the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible\ndata breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or\nmore other entities—such an eligible data breach of those\nother entities;\nuntil the Commissioner makes a decision in response to the\napplication for the declaration.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b) for\na declaration that, to any extent, relates to an eligible data breach of\nthe entity, sections 26WK and 26WL do not apply in relation to:\n\n(a) the eligible data breach; or\n\n(b) if the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible\ndata breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or\nmore other entities—such an eligible data breach of those\nother entities;\nuntil the Commissioner makes a decision in response to the\napplication for the declaration.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "84589b056d45b211d6d0dd0848ba90f56c4c351043a0a7a8b176d8265cfdb952",
      "skos:note": "Exemption from sections 26WK and 26WL for eligible data breach declarations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WQ(9) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(9) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b) for\na declaration that, to any extent, relates to an eligible data breach of\nthe entity, sections 26WK and 26WL do not apply in relation to:\n\n(a) the eligible data breach; or\n\n(b) if the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible\ndata breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or\nmore other entities—such an eligible data breach of those\nother entities;\nuntil the Commissioner makes a decision in response to the\napplication for the declaration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WQ(10) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "(10) An entity is not entitled to make an application under\nparagraph (5)(b) in relation to an eligible data breach of the entity\nif:\n\n(a) the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data\nbreach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more\nother entities; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\nNo. 12, 2017\n\n(b) one of those other entities has already made an application\nunder paragraph (5)(b) in relation to the eligible data breach\nof the other entity.\nExtension of specified period",
      "skos:definition": "(10) An entity is not entitled to make an application under\nparagraph (5)(b) in relation to an eligible data breach of the entity\nif:\n\n(a) the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data\nbreach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more\nother entities; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\nNo. 12, 2017\n\n(b) one of those other entities has already made an application\nunder paragraph (5)(b) in relation to the eligible data breach\nof the other entity.\nExtension of specified period",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3e6c3bfcf84401e8de33e25701c8aeb68f41f65c15e6d0aba4ddd5aabe26a594",
      "skos:note": "Entity cannot apply for data breach compensation if another entity has already applied."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WQ(10) Exception—declaration by Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "(10) An entity is not entitled to make an application under\nparagraph (5)(b) in relation to an eligible data breach of the entity\nif:\n\n(a) the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data\nbreach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more\nother entities; and\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments\n\nPrivacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017\nNo. 12, 2017\n\n(b) one of those other entities has already made an application\nunder paragraph (5)(b) in relation to the eligible data breach\nof the other entity.\nExtension of specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
