        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "37a60ed6ab1a9cb6fe02e2db31fef67b95b12b68a286dbfee980e7b954fa6b87",
      "skos:note": "Entity must notify eligible data breach upon request from Commissioner.",
      "dc:description": "Statement with entity details, data breach description, and response recommendations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WR(4) Commissioner may direct entity to notify eligible data breach",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The statement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) must set out:\n\n(a) the identity and contact details of the entity; and\n\n(b) a description of the eligible data breach that the\nCommissioner has reasonable grounds to believe has\nhappened; and\n\n(c) the kind or kinds of information concerned; and\n\n(d) recommendations about the steps that individuals should take\nin response to the eligible data breach that the Commissioner\nhas reasonable grounds to believe has happened."
    },
