    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26WR(9) Commissioner may direct entity to notify eligible data breach",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(9) If an entity normally communicates with a particular individual\nusing a particular method, the notification to the individual\nmentioned in paragraph (2)(a) or (b) may use that method. This\nsubsection does not limit paragraph (2)(a) or (b).\nCompliance with direction",
      "skos:definition": "(9) If an entity normally communicates with a particular individual\nusing a particular method, the notification to the individual\nmentioned in paragraph (2)(a) or (b) may use that method. This\nsubsection does not limit paragraph (2)(a) or (b).\nCompliance with direction",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-9-norm"
        },
