          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "185c7263467f04e7eb4a243ee188fee254216a6f836cbb1ad09044c7e4b2d87f",
      "skos:note": "Entity must comply with direction to notify eligible data breach"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017#sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26WR(9) Commissioner may direct entity to notify eligible data breach",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(9) If an entity normally communicates with a particular individual\nusing a particular method, the notification to the individual\nmentioned in paragraph (2)(a) or (b) may use that method. This\nsubsection does not limit paragraph (2)(a) or (b).\nCompliance with direction"
