      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of a prescribed secrecy provision:\n\n(a) paragraph 26WR(1)(b); and\n\n(b) subsection 26WR(2);\nare taken not to be provisions that require or authorise the use or\ndisclosure of information.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of a prescribed secrecy provision:\n\n(a) paragraph 26WR(1)(b); and\n\n(b) subsection 26WR(2);\nare taken not to be provisions that require or authorise the use or\ndisclosure of information.",
